WEBVTT

00:00:29.408 --> 00:00:31.038
You see, fire made us human;

00:00:31.038 --> 00:00:33.092
fossil fuels made us modern.

00:00:33.092 --> 00:00:34.392
But now we need a new fire

00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:37.915
that makes us safe, secure, healthy and durable.

00:00:37.915 --> 00:00:40.174
Let's see how.

00:00:40.174 --> 00:00:43.060
Four-fifths of the world's energy

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.833
still comes from burning each year

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:48.333
four cubic miles of the rotted remains

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.933
of primeval swamp goo.

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:53.067
Those fossil fuels

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:56.144
have built our civilization.

00:00:56.144 --> 00:00:58.213
They've created our wealth.

00:00:58.229 --> 00:00:59.805
They've enriched the lives of billions.

00:00:59.805 --> 00:01:02.444
But they also have rising costs